# ⛔ Nothing under package/native/ may be ignored here. The shipped native libraries
# are COMMITTED in this repository, and pub decides what a published archive holds
# by the ignore files from the repository root down: a native library an ignore rule
# matches is left out of the package whether or not it is committed. The release
# assembly refuses a .gitignore that matches a shipped native path.

# Build output
/build/
.dart_tool/
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
/coverage/
package/coverage/

# FVM
.fvm/

# Editors and operating systems
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.log
